    "bounding box" : [ 219.269, 528.7, 392.734, 542.17 ],
    "font" : "Roboto-Bold",
    "font size" : 11.495,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "PRESIDENTIAL DECREE NO. 1067"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 8,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 25.25, 452.261, 586.759, 507.112 ],
    "font" : "Roboto-Bold",
    "font size" : 11.495,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "A DECREE INSTITUTING A WATER CODE, THEREBY REVISING AND CONSOLIDATING THE LAWS GOVERNING THE OWNERSHIP, APPROPRIATION, UTILIZATION, EXPLOITATION, DEVELOPMENT, CONSERVATION AND PROTECTION OF WATER RESOURCES"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 9,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 24.951, 396.512, 587.045, 430.673 ],
    "font" : "Roboto-Regular",
    "font size" : 11.495,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "WHEREAS, Article XIV, Section 8 of the New Constitution of the Philippines provides, inter alia, that all waters of the Philippines belong to the State;"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 10,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 24.951, 340.764, 587.04, 374.924 ],
    "font" : "Roboto-Regular",
    "font size" : 11.495,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "WHEREAS, existing water legislations are piece-meal and inadequate to cope with increasing scarcity of water and changing patterns of water use;"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 11,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 24.951, 285.015, 587.037, 319.175 ],
    "font" : "Roboto-Regular",
    "font size" : 11.495,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "WHEREAS, there is a need for a Water Code based on rational concepts of integrated and multipurpose management of water resources and su ciently  exible to adequately meet future developments;"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 12,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 24.951, 229.266, 587.037, 263.427 ],
    "font" : "Roboto-Regular",
    "font size" : 11.495,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "WHEREAS, water is vital to national development and it has become increasingly necessary for government to intervene actively in improving the management of water resources;"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 13,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 24.951, 152.827, 587.045, 207.678 ],
    "font" : "Roboto-Regular",
    "font size" : 11.495,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "NOW, THEREFORE, I, FERDINAND E. MARCOS, President of the Philippines, by virtue of the powers in me vested by the Constitution, do hereby order and decree the enactment of the Water Code of the Philippines of 1976, as follows:"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 14,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 276.982, 117.769, 335.008, 131.239 ],
    "font" : "Roboto-Bold",
    "font size" : 11.495,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "CHAPTER I"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 15,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 202.842, 82.711, 409.151, 96.181 ],
    "font" : "Roboto-Bold",
    "font size" : 11.495,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Declaration of Objectives and Principles"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 16,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 24.951, 47.652, 408.554, 61.122 ],
    "font" : "Roboto-Regular",
    "font size" : 11.495,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "ARTICLE 1. This Code shall be known as The Water Code of the Philippines."
